Package: multiRL
Version: 0.1.8
Title: Reinforcement Learning Tools for Multi-Armed Bandit
Description: This package represents a significant extension of binaryRL. 
  Beyond handling complex multi-alternative choice tasks, multiRL enables the 
  specification of latent learning rules 
  Eckstein & Collins (2019) <doi:10.1073/pnas.1912330117>. 
  and incorporates the influence of working memory systems 
  Collins & Frank (2012) <doi:10.1111/j.1460-9568.2011.07980.x>. 
  within the framework of Markov Decision Processes.
